// @@@ If the index is valid (between 0 and the size of the list), then for every index from 0 up to but not including the specified index, each element at these indices either remains null if it was originally null or remains unchanged if it was not null.
--------------------
// @@@ If the index is valid (between 0 and the size of the list), then for every index from 0 up to, but not including, the specified index, the element at that position remains unchanged unless it was initially null.
